		{"id":"011680606b8290ee","type":"text","text":"Группа №6.\nОдинаковые\n\n1) Cut - cut - cut\n2) Put - put - put\n3) let - let - let\n4) Set - set - set\n5) Hit - hit - hit\n6) Rid - rid - rid\n7) Cost - cost - cost\n8) Read - read - read\n9) Upset - upset - upset\n10) Hurt - hurt - hurt\n11) Quit - quit - quit","x":5610,"y":1147,"width":369,"height":789},
		{"id":"7cebd82c6c0db139","type":"text","text":"Группа №1.\nI -- A\n1) Drink - drank - drunk\n2) Sit - sat - sat\n3) begin - began - begun\n4) ring - \n5) swim\n6) give - gave - given\n7) Forbid - forbade - forbidden\n8) Forgive - forgave - forgiven","x":5610,"y":358,"width":369,"height":789},
