		{"id":"97dbc09c62234912","type":"text","text":"Группа №10.\nДва одинаковых\n\n1. Hang - hung - hung\n2. Get - got - got\n3. Understand - understood - understood\n4. Tell - told - told\n5. Hear - heard - heard\n6. Make - made - made\n7. Pay - paid - paid\n8. Deal - dealt - dealt\n9. Feel - felt - felt\n10. Leave - left - left\n11. Shoot - shot - shot\n12. Hold - held - held\n13. Lose - lost - lost\n14. Mean - meant - meant\n15. Sell - sold - sold\n16. Win - won - won\n17. Stand - stood - stood\n18. Have - had - had\n19. Say - said - said","x":7076,"y":1147,"width":369,"height":789},
		{"id":"01a699427762fbd4","type":"text","text":"Группа №11.\nРазные\n\n1. Come - came - come\n2. See - saw - seen\n3. Eat - ate - eaten\n4. Write - wrote - written\n5. Do - did - done\n6. Drive - drove - driven\n7. Take - took - taken\n8. Run - ran - run\n9. Go - went - gone\n10. Fly - flew - flown\n11. Show - showed - shown\n12. Forget - forgot - forgotten\n13. Steal - stole - stolen\n14. Fall - fell - fallan\n15. Choose - chose - chosen\n16. Lia - lay - lain\n17. Prove - proved - proven\n18. Strive - strove - striven\n19. Hide - hid - hidden\n20. Become - became - become\n21. Bite - bit - bitten\n22. Draw - drew - drawn\n23. Beat - beat - beaten","x":7467,"y":358,"width":369,"height":1578},
		{"id":"588a0a29c22462ef","type":"text","text":"Группа №4.\neet - et\n\n1) Meet - met - met\n2) lead - led\n3) Feed - fed - fed\n4) breed - \n5) bleed - ","x":6707,"y":358,"width":369,"height":789},
		{"id":"76f04c168c79e774","type":"text","text":"Группа №9.\n-ore\n\n1) Wear - wore - worn\n2) Tear - tore - torn\n3) swear - swore - sworn","x":6707,"y":1147,"width":369,"height":789},
		{"id":"807ca253760a160c","type":"text","text":"Группа №7.\n-ought\n\n1) Fight - fought - fought\n2) Think - thought - thought\n3) Bring - brought - brought\n4) Seek - sought - sought\n5) Buy - bought - bought\n6) Teach - taught - taught\n7) Catch - caught - caught","x":5979,"y":1147,"width":369,"height":789},
		{"id":"1b4278c8c02cdeac","type":"text","text":"Группа №2.\nD -- T\n1) Send - sent - spent\n2) Build - built - built\n3) spend - spent\n4) Lend - \n5) bend - ","x":5979,"y":358,"width":369,"height":789},
		{"id":"d79e06214f0cc8f8","type":"text","text":"Слова\n***\nCount - считать, счет (цифры)\nConsider - считаем, расчет (думаем)\n***\n PresEnt - дарить, предоставлять, представлять. Present (сущ) - подарок\n Present - присутствовать. Present (сущ) - настоящее\n Future is mystery, Past is History. Only today is a God's gift That's why we call it Present.\n ***\n Carry - таскать (тяжести)\n Wear - носить (вещи)\n ***\n Early - рано(6:00); earlier - ранее (5:45)\n Before - раньше, до\n ***\n Big (большой) - bigger (больше)\n Much (много) - more (больше)\n ***\n Determine - определять\n ***\n Falls in love - влюбляться","x":920,"y":-1894,"width":581,"height":649},
